\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Gigi - Ch\'fa H\uc0\u432 \u417 u Cao C\u7893  Cao Nh\u7845 t Th\u7843 o Nguy\'ean\
\
M\uc0\u7897 t bu\u7893 i s\'e1ng n\u7855 ng \u273 \u7865 p tr\'ean th\u7843 o nguy\'ean ch\'e2u Phi, ch\'fa h\u432 \u417 u cao c\u7893  Gigi th\u7913 c d\u7853 y v\'e0 v\u432 \u417 n chi\u7871 c c\u7893  th\u7853 t d\'e0i l\'ean b\u7847 u tr\u7901 i.\
\
"Ch\'e0o m\uc0\u7863 t tr\u7901 i!" Gigi vui v\u7867  n\'f3i.\
\
C\'e1c b\uc0\u7841 n linh d\u432 \u417 ng b\'ean d\u432 \u7899 i ng\u432 \u7899 c nh\'ecn v\'e0 tr\u7847 m tr\u7891 :\
\
\'97 Gigi cao qu\'e1!\
\
\uc0\u272 i\u7873 u \u273 \'f3 ho\'e0n to\'e0n \u273 \'fang. H\u432 \u417 u cao c\u7893  l\'e0 lo\'e0i \u273 \u7897 ng v\u7853 t cao nh\u7845 t s\u7889 ng tr\'ean c\u7841 n. Gigi cao g\u7847 n b\u7857 ng m\u7897 t ng\'f4i nh\'e0 hai t\u7847 ng!\
\
Khi nh\uc0\u7919 ng con v\u7853 t kh\'e1c ph\u7843 i t\'ecm l\'e1 \u7903  nh\u7919 ng c\'e0nh th\u7845 p, Gigi ch\u7881  c\u7847 n v\u432 \u417 n c\u7893  l\'e0 c\'f3 th\u7875  \u259 n nh\u7919 ng chi\u7871 c l\'e1 xanh t\u432 \u417 i tr\'ean ng\u7885 n c\'e2y keo cao v\'fat.\
\
M\uc0\u7897 t ch\'fa ng\u7921 a v\u7857 n t\'f2 m\'f2 h\u7887 i:\
\
\'97 C\uc0\u7853 u kh\'f4ng th\u7845 y m\u7887 i c\u7893  sao?\
\
Gigi c\uc0\u432 \u7901 i:\
\
\'97 Kh\'f4ng \uc0\u273 \'e2u! Chi\u7871 c c\u7893  d\'e0i gi\'fap m\'ecnh nh\'ecn r\u7845 t xa v\'e0 t\'ecm \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\u7913 c \u259 n m\'e0 nhi\u7873 u lo\'e0i kh\'e1c kh\'f4ng v\u7899 i t\u7899 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c.\
\
Sau b\uc0\u7919 a s\'e1ng, Gigi c\'f9ng \u273 \'e0n \u273 i d\u7841 o tr\'ean th\u7843 o nguy\'ean r\u7897 ng l\u7899 n. T\u7915  xa, c\u7853 u nh\'ecn th\u7845 y m\u7897 t con s\u432  t\u7917  \u273 ang n\u7857 m ngh\u7881  d\u432 \u7899 i b\'f3ng c\'e2y.\
\
Nh\uc0\u7901  chi\u7873 u cao n\u7893 i b\u7853 t v\'e0 \u273 \'f4i m\u7855 t tinh t\u432 \u7901 ng, Gigi ph\'e1t hi\u7879 n nguy hi\u7875 m t\u7915  r\u7845 t s\u7899 m. C\u7853 u l\u7853 p t\u7913 c b\'e1o cho c\u7843  \u273 \'e0n:\
\
\'97 H\'e3y c\uc0\u7849 n th\u7853 n nh\'e9!\
\
Bu\uc0\u7893 i chi\u7873 u, Gigi ch\u7841 y \u273 ua c\'f9ng c\'e1c b\u7841 n. M\u7885 i ng\u432 \u7901 i \u273 \u7873 u b\u7845 t ng\u7901  khi ch\'fa h\u432 \u417 u cao c\u7893  cao l\u7899 n l\u7841 i ch\u7841 y r\u7845 t nhanh.\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh c\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  ch\u7841 y t\u7899 i 55 ki-l\'f4-m\'e9t m\u7897 t gi\u7901  \u273 \u7845 y! \'97 Gigi t\u7921  h\'e0o n\'f3i.\
\
Khi m\uc0\u7863 t tr\u7901 i l\u7863 n, Gigi \u273 \u7913 ng d\u432 \u7899 i b\u7847 u tr\u7901 i \u273 \u7847 y sao v\'e0 nhai nh\u7919 ng chi\u7871 c l\'e1 cu\u7889 i c\'f9ng trong ng\'e0y.\
\
C\uc0\u7853 u c\u7843 m th\u7845 y th\u7853 t h\u7841 nh ph\'fac v\'ec chi\u7871 c c\u7893  d\'e0i \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t c\u7911 a m\'ecnh kh\'f4ng ch\u7881  gi\'fap t\'ecm th\u7913 c \u259 n m\'e0 c\'f2n gi\'fap b\u7843 o v\u7879  c\u7843  \u273 \'e0n.\
\
T\uc0\u7915  \u273 \'f3, c\'e1c b\u7841 n \u273 \u7897 ng v\u7853 t \u273 \u7873 u hi\u7875 u r\u7857 ng m\u7895 i lo\'e0i \u273 \u7873 u c\'f3 nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7875 m \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t ri\'eang. V\'e0 ch\'ednh nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u kh\'e1c bi\u7879 t \u7845 y \u273 \'e3 gi\'fap ch\'fang t\u7891 n t\u7841 i trong thi\'ean nhi\'ean r\u7897 ng l\u7899 n.}